   "zivX2c": {
    "type": "GridEmbed",
    "mobile": {
     "top": 113,
     "left": 0,
     "width": 328,
     "height": 509
    },
    "content": "\n\n\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Montserrat\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n.accordion {\n  background-color: #eee;\n  color: #000;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 20px;\n  width: 100%;\n  border: none;\n  text-align: left;\n  outline: none;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-family: \"Montserrat\", sans-serif;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  transition: 0.4s;\n}\n\n.active, .accordion:hover {\n  background-color: #ccc;\n}\n\n.panel {\n  padding: 0 18px;\n  background-color: #fafafa;\n  font-size: 18px;\nfont-family: Montserrat;\nfont-weight: 200;\nline-height: 1.25;\n  max-height: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  transition: max-height 0.2s ease-out;\n}\nul {\ncolumn-count: 2;\n}\n</style>\n\n\n\n<button class=\"accordion\">How much does it cost to book Reagan Leonard Music?</button>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n \n  <p>Reagan has a minimum performance fee of $500. Typically, his prices range from <b>$500-$3000</b> depending on the event type, duration, travel, and other circumstances. For more information, please see <a href=\"https://reaganleonardmusic.com/pricing\" target=\"_blank\">the pricing page.</a></p>\n \n<p>If the pricing page doesn't answer your question or if you'd like to receive a custom quote for your event, please contact Reagan via the contact form at the bottom of this page!</p>\n \n</div>\n\n<button class=\"accordion\">What kinds of events does Reagan typically play? Will he perform at my event?</button>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n \n  <p>Reagan plays all sorts of events and is open to just about anything. However, he specializes in weddings, corporate events, and private parties.</p>\n \n<p>If you're wondering if he'll perform at your event...as long as he is available and you have a healthy entertainment budget, the answer is almost certainly yes!</p>\n \n</div>\n\n<button class=\"accordion\">What songs does Reagan play?</button>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n \n<p><b>Reagan can play just about anything if given enough advance notice!</b> His current repertoire is shown on the <a href=\"https://reaganleonardmusic.com/song-list\" target=\"_blank\">Song List</a> page.</p>\n \n</div>\n\n<button class=\"accordion\">Does Reagan supply his own equipment?</button>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n \n  <p>Yes! One of the best parts about hiring Reagan for your event is that all he needs is an outlet/extension cord nearby; he takes care of the rest. Reagan's full setup provides a huge amount of sound that will rock any venue, indoor or outdoor, up to 500 people!</p>\n \n<p>Reagan's full setup includes: 1 Bose L1 Compact System, a mic and mic stand, a Boss RC-30 looper (upon request), and all the necessary cables. He performs with a Takamine acoustic guitar.</p>\n \n</div>\n\n<button class=\"accordion\">Where is Reagan willing to perform? How far will he travel?</button>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n \n  <p>Reagan Leonard is currently based in Greer, SC. However, he is willing to travel up to 500 miles for a performance!</p>\n \n<p>(There is a flat fee of $100/hr for anything beyond 1 hour of round-trip travel. Please see <a href=\"https://reaganleonardmusic.com/pricing\" target=\"_blank\">the pricing page</a> or contact Reagan for more info.)</p>\n \n</div>\n\n<button class=\"accordion\">How long of a performance can Reagan put on?</button>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n \n  <p>Reagan can perform for up to 5 hours (with a 10 to 15-minute break for every hour played). Most of his performances range from 2-3 hours but he is absolutely willing to play for more or less time if needed.</p>\n \n</div>\n\n<script>\nvar acc = document.getElementsByClassName(\"accordion\");\nvar i;\n\nfor (i = 0; i < acc.length; i++) {\n  acc[i].addEventListener(\"click\", function() {\n    this.classList.toggle(\"active\");\n    var panel = this.nextElementSibling;\n    if (panel.style.maxHeight) {\n      panel.style.maxHeight = null;\n    } else {\n      panel.style.maxHeight = panel.scrollHeight + \"px\";\n    } \n  });\n}\n</script>\n\n\n\n",
